ens onder wisselende leiding. Zo ontstaat een verzameling van honderd vertellingen binnen één overkoepelend kader. Liefde, toeval en menselijk handelen krijgen in die verschillende verhalen steeds een andere vorm. Boccaccio plaatst het vertellen zelf tegenover de dreiging waaruit het gezelschap is weggegaan en laat de stemmen van de deelnemers naast elkaar bestaan.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://www.dbnl.org/tekst/deni002nede01_01/deni002nede01_01_0002.php","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p790366460"],"reference":"work:400","checked_at":"2026-11-02T21:30:06.460Z","note":"Complete1982Manteau715p FransDenissen translation bound by KB and independent translator bibliography DBNL. Explicitly distinguished from1997Naegels20-story anthology and older abridged child adaptations. Reuse existing Work400; do not guess language of legacyDécaméron9781234915209.","supplemental":null,"existingAlternativeReview":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-018.json","sources":["https://www.dbnl.org/tekst/deni002nede01_01/deni002nede01_01_0002.php","https://www.boekenplatform.nl/decamerone-296997","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL7180368W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p790366460"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","cover_id":6781764,"sha256":"8b5330920c726d796f87ba232966c199fda10fc6d8efa541b1f42e1f63c06ca1","reference":"cover-semantic-review-010.json","limitation":"Actually read cover-large/sheet-002.jpg. Boccaccio; Decamerone. Check complete versus abridged edition independently. Front identity and source-edition attachment are corroboration, not proof of a visible barcode, printing year, language or complete contents. Bibliographic checks remain separate."}],"provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T21:30:06.460Z","review_batch":"nl-sca