on_id":"OL24356700M"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":987116004,"title":"De voor- en tegenspoeden van de befaamde Moll Flanders die in Newgate werd geboren en ... stierf","language":"dut","open_library_edition_id":"OL24356700M","isbn_13":"9789027491022","isbn_10":null,"publisher":"Het Spectrum","id":987216008,"publish_date":null,"cover_id":null}},{"ref":"d2","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":987116004,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":987116004,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":987316003,"text":"Moll Flanders vertelt over een leven waarin bestaanszekerheid zelden vanzelfsprekend is. Geboren in de gevangenis probeert zij via relaties, huwelijken en later ook misdaad een plaats in de samenleving te vinden. Haar eigen verslag biedt tegelijk bekentenis en rechtvaardiging. Daniel Defoe laat zien hoe overleven, geld en maatschappelijke verwachtingen haar keuzes bepalen. De roman gebruikt de vorm van persoonlijke herinneringen om een wereld te verkennen waarin respectabiliteit en afhankelijkheid voortdurend van betekenis veranderen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://www.deslegte.com/de-voor-en-tegenspoeden-van-de-befaamde-moll-flanders-600715/","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p801757428"],"reference":"work:1507","checked_at":"2026-11-02T21:30:06.460Z","note":"Same complete Defoe1722MollFlanders novel, Dutch MaxSchuchart1978Spectrumhardcover9789027491022. Exact bibliographic title includes ellipsis and subtitle, not a content-summary or abridgement marker. Keep original English Work1507 and add independently verified Dutch edition; no new Work.","supplemental":{"formatSource":"https://www.deslegte.com/de-voor-en-tegenspoeden-van-de-befaamde-moll-flanders-600715/","review":"ExactISBN9789027491022/KBp801757428 full bibliographic long title extends the preserved OL title only by geschreven naar haar eigen aantekeningen. Punctuation/subtitle difference, same1722Defoe novel and MaxSchuchart translation. Not abridged inferred from ellipsis: ellipsis is actually in subtitle/title statement."},"existingAlternativeReview":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-019.json","sources":["https://www.deslegte.com/de-voor-en-tegenspoeden-van-de-befaamde-moll-flanders-600715/","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL45139W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p801757428"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","cover_id":6582591,"sha256":"a5b127e3ea278baf96cada2f678dae41514225f4088c442db8f14d07aba789e3","reference":"cover-semantic-review-010.json","limitation":"Actually read cover-large/sheet-003.jpg. Daniel Defoe; Moll Flanders; Kramers Klassieken. Full selected bibliographic title is longer, not a different novel. Front identity and source-edition attachment are corroboration, not proof of a visible barcode, printing year, language or complete contents. Bibliographic checks remain separate."}],"provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T21:30:06.460Z","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-017"}},{"ref":"m2","relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","key":{"edition_id":"@e2"},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":"@e2","work_id":987116004,"bound_author_id":987316003,"bound_title":"De voor- en tegenspoeden van de befaamde Moll Flanders die in Newgate werd geboren en ... stierf","bound_language":"dut","bound_isbn13":"9789027491022","format":"hardcover","cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/6582591-L.jpg?default=false","card_cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/6582591-M.jpg?default=false","evidence_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p801757428","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p801757428"],"reference":"work:1507","checked_at":"2026-11-02T21:30:06.460Z","note":"Same complete Defoe1722MollFlanders novel